lid port and a denied taskkill operation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort 8000,8001 -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object LocalAddress, LocalPort, State, OwningProcess\"","Cwd":"\"D:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Checking ports 8000 and 8001\"","toolSummary":"\"Check listening processes on 8000 and 8001\""}}]}
